  "summary": "This paper proposes Quantum Gated Recurrent Neural Networks (QGRNNs), specifically QLSTM and QGRU, as gate-based variational quantum models for sequence learning. It reports strong empirical results on the adding problem at T = 750, synthetic gene-regulatory prediction with relative error on the order of 10^-3, and stock forecasting on 12 tickers from 2018-01-01 to 2023-01-01, using only 63 parameters for QLSTM and 42 for QGRU; however, no hardware-specific quantum advantage is demonstrated.",
